{"version":1,"key":"card:73","content":{"id":73,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8cf267c0-4751-4c7b-8df1-c3476a1d4fc2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Obsidian 官方的同步很贵，用不起，但是为了能在移动端和 PC 端都能使用 Obsidian，同步时必须要做的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09198a61-afe9-4043-8d9f-da6f3481e21a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有 Android 手机，那么时很好同步的，因为 PC 和 iPhone 可以通过 iCloud 来进行同步，并且是实时的，但是 Android 手机上无法使用 iCloud，两种办法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"649e00a4-7701-40f1-862d-10876fe824c4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7bdda324-97f7-4251-917f-90e26f8f91fc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24784add-1a90-4ac3-a1f9-d24bc2f38626","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其它云同步软件：坚果云，谷歌云、OneDrive"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a1465b08-fd80-43b0-ace6-dd0c37bcb94b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78e07a17-c3fc-4aae-8d47-dd4d75dd8501","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1fa4a8d9-3108-46d4-8e25-db26cbc317d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"坚果云是属实有毛病，每次只能同步几百个文件，光同步都要好久，不可取，因为其它的我也想用 iCloud，无法直接同步 iCloud 中的东西，反正折腾了很久，云同步这边失败了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"abffc949-49de-4a5c-840c-a62552055374","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面来到了 Git，有一个插件 Obsidian-Git，但是我试了，没有任何内容下载，不知道什么情况。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c46a05b-8fb6-4b40-b435-7ba44bc9e934","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后下了个安卓的软件 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"MGit"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，发现无法下载私人仓库，输了密码也一直说没权限，无语，但是由于笔记中有日记，所以另开了仓库，放无日记版的笔记，做法就是另开了一个分支 mobile，然后不追踪日记这个文件夹，并把 mobile 这个分支的内容推到另一个仓库。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"019167c2-49dc-425d-a252-b0feb00a9472","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过这样当每次 master 分支改动时，我都要 merge 到 mobile，然后推送，然后在手机端手动下拉，很麻烦，不过链路跑通，能用，先这样吧。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bce93520-c2a1-4499-99e3-0f65751c0ee5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在折腾的过程也收获了一些 Git 和 Github 的操作，见："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"74f592aa-725b-4827-a910-ff8cea9eb56f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2a15eb07-fb12-4fe7-b9f8-228265793a8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f77091cf-f951-429f-9d83-89073333bf32","children":[{"type":"content-link","refId":93,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":89,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"ffa1eac9-1f00-4a0e-97cb-6c207f43db52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Github 删除分支"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6fe7b315-6a85-486b-9780-20054bb53dae","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6cc9563-9dd6-40a6-bcbd-7cc6bd976090","children":[{"type":"content-link","refId":49,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":46,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"e115c8d7-bfb6-4143-ac92-1b917b3a18ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git 不追踪已经提交了的文件"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["Obsidian"],"createTime":1689167136076,"updateTime":1744172349649,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744172349649},"links":{"card:93":{"key":"card:93","type":"card","id":93},"card:49":{"key":"card:49","type":"card","id":49}}}